From 906757bbcff35f65b1ebdc79cba3c7088ddafac8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Guilherme Ivo Bozi <guilherme.bozi@usp.br>
Date: Thu, 11 Jun 2026 16:49:04 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 01794/15333] drm/amd/display: convert dcn21 GPIO translation
 to lookup tables

Replace dcn21 GPIO translation switch statements with the
generic table-based translation helpers.

This simplifies the GPIO mapping logic and reduces duplicated
translation code.

No functional changes intended.

Signed-off-by: Guilherme Ivo Bozi <guilherme.bozi@usp.br>
Tested-by: Dan Wheeler <daniel.wheeler@amd.com>
Acked-by: George Zhang <george.zhang@amd.com>
Signed-off-by: Alex Deucher <alexander.deucher@amd.com>
---
